WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.750
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.700
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.030
My Aoki award-winning novelist Mama,
and her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.700
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.370
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.040
Just drifting along!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.460
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.380
Nice to meet you.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.840
I'm Gojo. It's a pleasure.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.350
Kurata Sana. The pleasure is mine.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.230
Were you surprised?

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.360
"Right arm"

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.360
Yes, I was.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.320
"The Delirious Nick-of-Time Deadline"

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.070
Good morning!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.490
How is everyone!? Listen, listen!
I got one! I got one!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.410
Ba-bing, ba-bing,
for the first time in a long time,

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.740
I got a job!

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.080
--Really!? That's terrific, Sana-chan!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.750
Did you hear that, Akito-kun? That's great.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.670
Yeah.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.340
Get this. You know how the way all
of my work was suddenly cancelled...

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.670
...was the doing of Drea-Pro,
short for Dreaming Pro, right?

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.680
Well, little by little, this one producer
came forward and reconsidered.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.680
So, what kind of work is this new job?

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.680
Ha ha! It's a drama!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:48.690
I play the girl who loses her memory
after witnessing a murder,

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:52.020
whose life is then sought after
by a criminal she's never seen's...

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.360
...ordinary neighbor girl,
who lives in the house behind her!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.360
Which is to say, it's just a bit part.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.030
What's the name of this show?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.360
When is it on?

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:05.370
Allow me to announce it! The program's
name is "Late-Night Chaos Theater"!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.700
Never heard of it.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.040
It's on every Wednesday,
at 3 o'clock in the morning!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.710
I'm usually asleep then.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.710
Also, my dad will be played
by Gojo Takeshi-san!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:17.380
Sorry, Sana-chan, but we're not
at all familiar with any of it.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.380
"Late-Night Chaos Theater"

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.380
Babbit had never heard about it, either.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.720
And so, for today's Language Arts,
we'll be writing compositions.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.050
Oh, class has started.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.060
Compositions? What a drag...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.690
I love writing compositions.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.650
Composition?

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:38.030
Composition... composition...
composition...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.990
Um, Kurata-san, is something the matter?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.660
Composition...

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.700
Essay!!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.040
Essay?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.000
You mean, the one
Onda-san asked you for?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.370
Right. I forgot!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.040
I was so preoccupied
from all the confusion

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.040
about not having any work, and all...

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:01.720
Let's see, when was that deadline?
The essay deadline...

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.050
Next Monday?!

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:07.350
Which means,
exactly one week from today?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.730
So, how much do you have done already?

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.690
Let's see... "I...

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.060
comma.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.060
That's it?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.860
That's it.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.030
S- Sana-chan, how much
do you still have to do?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.700
The thing is...

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.410
I have this much more to do.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.000
Wow, it's all of 9.57 cm!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Say, what are you going to do, Sana-chan?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.000
It's hard enough to write a two-page
composition for Language Arts.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.130
It would be impossible to write
9.57 cm worth in one week,

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.010
no matter what you did, wouldn't it?

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.680
Impossible or not, I have to write it.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.140
Even if the sun were
to rise in the west,

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.350
or a great demon king ghost
were to descend from the skies,

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.020
I have to do it. I've got to do it.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.360
You know, you could have your
deadline extended, couldn't you?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.530
Right! Sana-chan, your mama
is always running away

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.690
and getting hers extended, isn't she?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.690
That's right! I could do that!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.030
If I do all I can and it's not enough,
I can appeal to Onda-san!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.700
Sensei, are you okay with this?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.490
Ordinarily, I wouldn't be.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.370
Huh? You've decided not to
publish Kurata Sana's book?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.380
Yeah, well, you see, Drea-Pro's President
Yumezono-sama here...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.380
You see, I asked the editor in chief here
if he wouldn't publish my book-

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.050
Hey! You're not shooting me!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:29.050
-if he wouldn't publish my book.
The title is...

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.970
"Guts! The Entertainment World
of Tenamonya and Sucharaka."

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.650
It dishes out tons of dirt on the
entertainment world. This book will sell!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.650
I wrote it with the intention of taking it
to a different publishing house,

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.320
but if you will kill Kurata Sana's book,
then I will turn it over to you.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.320
Editor-in-Chief!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:50.320
I read his manuscript earlier,
and it is terribly interesting.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.950
Editor-in-Chief, we're the ones who
requested Kurata Sana to write for us.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.330
We can't just suddenly...

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:59.630
B- but, this will truly sell.
Really, I mean like mad.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.670
Right, President Yumezono?

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.670
Right, Editor-in-Chief.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.670
T- this can't be...

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.920
"Sana-chan, not knowing
anything about this..."

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:19.020
It's working! It's working! It's working!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.020
Fight!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:24.030
Aah, Sana-chan has had all of
those drinks just since this evening.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.400
But I guess it's okay.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.030
It looks like Sana-chan is
finally getting down to business.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.660
Sagami-kun, you have no idea.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.660
There are 77 terrifying traps
that await a writer before a deadline,

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:40.750
in the baffling and frightening
Mystery Zone!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.340
S- Sensei, what are these 77 mysteries?

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.050
Just watch.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.090
"The secrets of the terrifying traps
will now be revealed..."

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:54.100
"And so, to me, those three days
of outdoor school were..."

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.270
S- Sana-chan, what in the world
is the matter!?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.690
Is there a kanji you don't
know how to write!?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.690
It's dirty!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.690
Look! Look! The tip
of my mechanical pencil!

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.690
Where?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.440
Look! Here! Here!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:11.700
--Where?
--Look closer! It's there! See? See?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.030
W- where?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.700
Look closer!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.370
Here, here!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.370
See? It's dirty, right?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.370
I can't stand it! This dirt
is really bothering me!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.380
There!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.040
Now that it's clean,
the work can go forward.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.710
Sana-chan, you'll be okay now, right?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.010
I'm okay, I'm okay!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.300
Sana-chan, now what is ill?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.970
The mandarin orange box is dirty!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.300
The mandarin orange box?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.760
--Aah! So is my pad! And my
pen case is dirty, too!
--This is number 5 of the 77 traps:

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.100
--And now that I look at it,
so is my sitting cushion!
--the "bothered by strange things" trap.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.350
--Wah, the tatami mats and
the walls are dirty, too!
--Sana-chan!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.810
--Aah, time to clean! Time to clean!
--Sana-chan! Get hold of yourself!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.980
--Time to clean!
--Hurry and get out of the trap!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.980
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no! I have to write!
I have to write! I have to write!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.320
"30 minutes pass"

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.650
"To me, those three days of
outdoor school are radiant memories."

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.990
Oh, I'm moving now!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.620
"Even after I become an aunt,
or a grandma,

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.660
I will never forget them."

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.990
Good! Good!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.330
"Especially... especially..."
Especially?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.000
Especially... what was it?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.000
That's right! I have the essay I wrote then!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.340
If I can just arrange that one,
I can whip right through writing this!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.840
Ah, this takes me back! This is the album
from when I was in 2nd grade!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.350
There's a picture of Hayama in here!

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:21.140
--This is number 27 of the 77 traps:
--I guess he used to be this small too, huh?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.020
--the "this sure takes me back" trap.
--That's so funny!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.020
Sana-chan...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.360
Please, Sana-chan!
Realize the trap you're in!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.280
Oh, no! Oh, no! I have to write!
I have to write! I have to write!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.900
"1 hour passes"

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.900
Okay, an hour has gone by.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.620
I'm hungry.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:41.620
S- Sana-chan, I thought this might happen,
so I made you some egg porridge.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.960
I want to eat ramen.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.630
That specially-made ramen I ate
when I was over at Hayama's place.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:50.000
--Um, Sana-chan, look, look...
--If I don't eat that, I don't think
I'll be able to write my manuscript.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.300
I'm going to run to the convenience store!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.670
Sana-chan!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:57.640
--Number 63: the "I have to eat that,
no matter what" trap.
--S- Sana-chan! Ow! Hot! Sana-chan!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.680
Sana-chan, after you eat,
make sure you get back to writing.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.680
I know.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.900
"2 hours pass"

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.980
Bedtime.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:09.360
All right! Let's get cracking!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.030
Well, I'm brushing my teeth
and going to bed.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.900
Sorry, but I have to start work
early tomorrow, too.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:23.000
Would they typically go to bed
and not stay up with me?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.960
I am a girl all alone...

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.380
For some reason, I'm writing
quickly and with ease!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.630
I really am writing like crazy!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.890
That's it! The reason I couldn't
concentrate up to now

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.640
was because Mama and Rei-kun
were watching me!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:44.640
♪ I'm writing quickly, life is easy! ♪

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.640
♪ I'll clear my deadline,
terrific, terrific! ♪

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.980
♪ I'm writing, I'm writing, minus plus! ♪

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.980
♪ Like a two-humped camel,
trudging along easily, ♪

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.650
♪ before I know it! ♪

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.320
Woo-hoo! 5.25 cm written!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.450
Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.990
Morning edition.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.330
Keep up the good work.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.660
What!?

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.670
Don't tell me, by any chance,
could it be, please, no!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:10.500
"Completely blank"

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.670
Sana-chan has gone faceless from shock.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.340
Double-shock faceless!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.010
Still just seven lines...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.340
S- Sana-chan!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:22.100
Number 77: the "that was
just a dream!" trap.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.350
Sana-chan...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:29.350
I can't help falling asleep. I can't help it,
I can't help it, I can't help it!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.270
Sana-chan, you don't have to dance around.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.280
I have to ask Onda-san
to extend my deadline.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.610
I don't think he'll let you.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.940
Yeah, yeah!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.950
Terrible news! Terrible news! Sana-chan!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.280
Sana-chan, terrible news!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.950
What do you want?

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.950
Huh? Onda-san, what's wrong?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.290
Oh, Sana-chan!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.960
Huh!? The president of Drea-Pro!?

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.790
He's not satisfied with
just the entertainment industry,

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.960
he's into publishing now!?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.630
What a dirty bastard.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:11:01.640
I wish I could help, but it's time for
Ayana-chan's milk. I must be leaving now.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.310
So, after haggling with
the editor in chief...

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.310
If you're that insistent
about Kurata Sana's book,

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.310
I'll make my decision after
I see the completed manuscript.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.980
The deadline is Monday morning, right?
I'll wait until then.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.190
So Sana-chan, you have to meet
the deadline, no matter what!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.990
Please, Sana-chan!

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.660
That was the last thing
I wanted to hear, sir.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.160
We're raking it in just by being alive.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.510
It would be impossible for
a normal human to go to school

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.630
and finish writing it by Monday.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.970
I'm not going to be beaten by
that mean old fink's dirty tricks!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.970
That's it, Sana-chan! That's the spirit!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.970
Hang in there, Sana-chan!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.980
All righty! Let's do this!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.150
"However... it's very hard
when you actually try to"

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.150
That's pretty wishful thinking.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:58.190
Hey! As of this week, Sana-chan,
who you've awl been waiting for, is back!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.650
Thank you.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.990
Sana-chan, you're gone
for just a little while,

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.660
--and you look wasted away!
--I am wasting away.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:10.500
After all, these days, I've got school,
the TV station, and my manuscript.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:18.000
♪ Every day, every day,
with mechanical pencil in hand, ♪

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:24.010
♪ my neck is stiff,
and my eyes are groggy, ♪

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:32.270
♪ I am worn out from work... ♪

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.650
She's sleeping with her eyes open.
Hey, hey!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:43.150
Sana-chan! Hello, are you awake,
Sana-chan? Hey, Sana-chan!

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.320
This week's Sana-chan.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.660
You don't say, you don't say.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:52.660
The strain of each day
has already worn her out.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.330
Still, President,

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.330
how about a little obstructive handiwork,
just in case?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:02.340
We can't do anything so sneaky.
I'm a man of fair play, after all.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.680
You've pulled all sorts
of dirty tricks up to now!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:07.220
There's no reason why
the strain on her won't continue

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.680
without us having to obstruct her.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.350
Pardon me, what is your favorite color?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.680
Iridescent.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.020
What karaoke song do you like to sing?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.020
"Sneaky Man."

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:18.690
Ho ho ho, you are a sneaky,
nasty man beyond any help!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:20.360
Yes, yes.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.480
Punishing hammer!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.030
W- was that a ghost? Was that a ghost?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.700
Sometimes irrational things
happen in this anime...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.620
Ka-ching!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.290
Sana-chan, hang in there.
We're behind you!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.290
Besides, I'm looking forward
to reading your essay, Sana-chan.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.290
So am I.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.960
Thank you, thank you.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.300
Looks like Sana-chan is toughing it out.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.300
Yeah.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.930
Aya-chan, thank you.
All right, back to writing!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.640
Whoa, that's cold!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.980
All right, now I'm awake!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.360
Kurata...

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.320
Huh? This is unusual, Gomi-kun-
you talking to me.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.660
Why do you always try so hard like this?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.330
Doesn't it wear you out?

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.410
Oh, it does wear me out.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.620
Especially nowadays, my neck is stiff,
and I have finger calluses.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.000
Why? What's the matter, Gomi-kun?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.000
The way you do that...

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.340
...it's not that great or anything.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.970
Gomi-kun... Hey, hold on, now, Gomi-kun!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.260
What's with him?

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.760
Okay, this is a take!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.390
"Now shooting"

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.680
Oomph... oomph...

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.650
Cut!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.150
Okay, 20 minute break!

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.990
I've gotta write, I've gotta write...

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:52.280
"At that moment,
I just lost my 'temperance'..."

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.280
Working hard, huh?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:58.620
Hey. You're always writing something
whenever we get a break, huh?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.000
It's an essay.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.670
Why are you working so hard on it?

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.960
Oh, if I were going to explain
it in 50 words or less...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.010
There are some mean characters
out there in the world,

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.340
and there's no way I want to let myself
be beaten by their dirty tricks!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.300
And that's why I'm working so hard.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.680
Ah. Doesn't it tire you out?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:19.020
I do get tired, but still,
it's a lot of fun to write.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:23.980
That's marvelous. You are indeed
Kurata Misako-san's daughter.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.690
Actually, we're...

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:29.650
I know. I've read "My Daughter and I."

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.950
Still, there's more to parents
and children than blood relations.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.950
You grew up watching your mother
writing her manuscripts,

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.620
so that's why you're writing too, Sana-chan.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:43.920
Writing is the bond between
you and your mother, Sana-chan.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.800
Or whatever.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.090
Here.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.300
Well, keep working at it.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.890
Thank you, Gojo-san.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.650
Surprised you?

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.230
That's in pretty poor taste.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.610
Sensei, can't you negotiate
with the editor in chief

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.660
to get him to extend
the deadline a few days?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.660
I could, if I told him I wouldn't write
for his company anymore, or something.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.660
Well?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.080
But then, if we did that,

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.670
we would be stooping to the same level
as Drea-Pro's president.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:30.920
I always want her to conduct
herself fair and square.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:35.720
Besides, once in a while, I like to watch
other people suffer to meet a deadline!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.640
"One day left"

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.610
Akito-kun?

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:51.280
You came too, Akito-kun!

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.450
She said her deadline
was tomorrow morning, right?

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.280
Akito-kun?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:02.080
It's exasperating, not being
able to do anything for her.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.970
I think it's working...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:23.310
You know, kids shouldn't
rely on that stuff so much.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.640
Fight!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:29.650
Sana-chan... Sana-chan... Aah! Of all
the times to have to go to Aomori...

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.150
...for a general meeting of the
Eastern Japan Free Managers Society!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.280
I... I...

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.610
Your dismal attitude is
getting in the way here.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:37.950
B- but...

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.280
Sana-chan, just a little bit more now!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.620
Mm-hmm, I'll go drop it off at your office
the first thing in the morning.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.960
Sorry I can't come here
to pick it up for you.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.000
If only I didn't have

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.960
this general meeting of the Eastern Japan
Free Managers Society in Aomori,

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.960
I could deliver it in her place!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.630
Hurry up and go to work!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.300
But! But! But!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.800
Sana-chan, hang in there!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.640
Sensei, I have to be going.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:05.640
Onda-kun, relax. As this girl's mother,
I will watch over her closely.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:12.190
"Mother watching over me"

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.310
Mother, what are you doing?

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.190
I'm watching over you.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.820
"Mother exhaustively watching over me"

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.320
Mother...

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.650
I'm watching over you.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.820
Stop it.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.870
"To tell you the truth...
the thing that I...

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.750
ba-bing... made up my mind...
to do at the time..."

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:41.600
S- so sleepy... Maybe I should
go to sleep right now...

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.720
It would feel so good... I wouldn't
have to think of anything...

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.600
just me and my warm futon...

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.440
It's okay... if I don't
finish my manuscript...

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.940
if I don't finish my book...

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.360
if that mean old Drea-Pro
company president beats me...

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:01.030
it's okay...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.620
What is it!? What is it!? What is it!?

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.460
Hayama? Are you waking me up?

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.720
Hayama, thank you.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:31.560
Thanks to you, I can keep
working hard. I can keep writing.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:38.150
I wonder if he really does
have a crush on me...

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:48.910
This is no time to be thinking
about that! Work! Work!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.810
Thank you, Hayama. I'll keep working.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:15.270
Morning has arrived. Are you done?

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.650
9.57 cm!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.320
It's finished!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.610
Well done.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:28.330
All right! I'll be back soon!!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.910
My daughter, be careful.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.920
I'm barely going to make it!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.590
Sana-chan, please make it in time.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.590
Onda-san!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.590
Sana-chan!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:46.260
I'm finally finished!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.260
Whoops! Whoops! I went too far!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.600
Stop, Mr. Onda.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.930
I'm finished! I'm finished, Onda-san!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.270
Sana-chan, you did it!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.610
And just barely in time.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.360
Yay!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.360
She made it in time, huh?
Sassy little girl!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:12.120
Ah, I'm so sleepy, I won't
last until I get home...

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.960
A bench, huh?

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.960
The bench is calling me...

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:26.590
I'll just get a teensy little
bit of rest before I go...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.970
Ah, I'm so sleepy...

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.980
Want to come over to my place?

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.310
Hmm? Sana-chan?

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.060
What, a friend of yours?

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:41.780
That girl is the one on "Child's Toy."

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.650
You can go home!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:48.990
What!? I accompanied you the whole night,
because you said you were lonely.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:50.660
What do you mean by suddenly
telling me to go-

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:51.660
Bye now.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.660
Hold on! Hold on, I said! I'm never
fooling around with you again!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.620
You dumbass! You good-for-nothing!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:03.460
Kurata Sana with a middle-aged actor,
huh? I can make use of this.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.640
It's so warm...

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:37.960
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.750
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:42.880
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:45.550
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:47.510
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.340
so resolve when to give up

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:51.260
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:52.640
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:54.310
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:56.930
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.390
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.980
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.610
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:07.150
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:09.950
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:12.240
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:14.160
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:17.500
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:21.330
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:25.630
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.550
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:30.380
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.300
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:35.180
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:37.060
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.020
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:39.140 --> 00:23:40.890
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:42.810
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:47.690
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:50.360
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:52.280
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.200
so resolve when to give up

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:57.830
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:57.870 --> 00:24:00.040
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.000
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:03.420
(Mou man tail)

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:10.340
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:14.550
Whoa, I fell dead asleep!
And when I woke up, whoa!

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:16.350
Why is Gojo-san in my bed!?

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:19.350
Huh? That's not it? Then what happened?
And while we're trying to slip away,

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.100
Gojo-san and I become
the object of gossip,

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:23.690
and it's such a pain that I just
declare that he's my boyfriend!

00:24:23.690 --> 00:24:25.270
Oh, now I've done it.

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:27.020
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 43,

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:29.280
where the curtain finally
rises on new developments:

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:32.950
My Boyfriend is Like a Father To Me

00:24:32.950 --> 00:24:36.070
Once again, you're acting
without thinking, Sana-chan.
